rejecta, licet eadem causa omnes implicet, 167,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">vers. 703 et seq</HI>  Cur id ignorare non obsit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid. vers. 709
et seqq.</HI>  Sicut nec oberat olim nescire omnes gentes fore ad
