natura, unus regnet, alter serviat, etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid. vers.
721 et seqq.</HI>  Cum tot varietutum manifestarum causae lateant,
 <COL N="0965"></COL> nemo tamen arguit earum auctorem Deum, 169,
